<title>JAPAN: BOXING-PENALOSA WINS WBVC SUPER-FLY CROWN.</title>
<headline>BOXING-PENALOSA WINS WBVC SUPER-FLY CROWN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gerry Penalosa of the Philippines won the WBC super-flyweight title when he outpointed holder Hiroshi Kawashima of Japan on Thursday.</p>
</text>
